        openings: ("At 9:40 p.m., a gas station camera recorded {D} grabbing {V}, {D.his} ex-partner, by the arm and pushing {V.him} into a car. Hours later a deputy found {V} walking a dark road miles away with a swollen eye and no phone.", "{V} got in willingly and asked to be driven away from a fight. A grab to help someone into a car, in the middle of a bad argument, is not a kidnapping."),
