        role: "Sporting goods store clerk",
        exam: [.direct("Please describe your job at the sporting goods store.", "\"I work as a clerk at a sporting goods store. I sell firearms, ammunition, and hunting gear, and I keep records of every firearm sale.\""), .direct("Who bought the shotgun?", "\"{D}. {D.He} came in, picked a shotgun, and paid with a card. The receipt shows the date, which was six days before the shootings.\""), .direct("What did {D} say about why {D} wanted it?", "\"Hunting. {D.He} said {D.he} planned to go hunting, and I wrote that down in the usual notes. {D.He} did not seem unusual.\""), .direct("How did you learn about the shootings?", "\"Deputies came to the store. They asked about the shotgun and compared the shells found at the scene with the shotgun {DL} bought.\""), .direct("What did the shells show?", "\"They match the shotgun {DL} bought a week earlier. The lab report says the shells came from that gun.\""), .direct("Did the defendant ask any unusual questions?", "\"Not that I remember. {D.He} asked about shells and the barrel. Many customers ask the same, and I did not think anything of it.\""), .cross("Did the defendant pay in cash?", "\"No. {DL} used a card. That means the purchase is easy to trace, and I did not see {DL} try to hide it.\""), .cross("Did the defendant say anything about family or money?", "\"No. {D.He} did not mention family. I did not know anything about {V}, and I only learned about the case afterward.\""), .cross("Was the defendant calm when buying?", "\"Yes. {D.He} was calm and polite. I did not see anything that made me worry.\""), .cross("Could someone else have used the shotgun?", "\"I do not know. I only know who bought it. I do not know where it was kept after the sale.\""), .cross("Do many customers buy shotguns for hunting?", "\"Yes. Most shotgun buyers say hunting or sport. I have no reason to doubt what {D.he} said.\"")],
