        truths: ("{DL} showed up at {V}'s gym and work.", "The location log shows {DL} following hours later."),
        defendant: [.direct("Please tell us about your relationship with {V}.", "\"We were together for a while. When {V} moved out, I was hurt, and I wanted to understand what went wrong.\""), .direct("Why was a tracker in {V}'s car?", "\"It was a lost-item tag that I bought for something of my own. I left it in the car by accident when we were together.\""), .direct("Did you follow {V}?", "\"No. I did not. I did not set out to track anyone, and I did not mean to scare {V}.\""), .direct("Why did you show up at the gym and at work?", "\"I go to that gym too. I did not think it was a problem. I did not go to {V}'s work on purpose.\""), .direct("Why did your phone follow {V}'s route?", "\"A coincidence. We live in the same area, and we use the same roads. I did not follow {V}.\""), .direct("How has this affected you?", "\"I feel awful. I did not mean for {V} to feel afraid, and I wish I had given {V} more space.\""), .cross("The tracker was registered to your account, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. It was. It was my lost-item tag, and I did not mean to leave it in the car.\""), .cross("The location log shows your phone following {V}, doesn't it?", "\"It shows my phone near {V}'s route. I did not follow, and I do not know why the times match.\""), .cross("You showed up at {V}'s gym and work, didn't you?", "\"I go to the gym too. I did not go to work to find {V}. I know it looks bad, but I was not stalking.\""), .cross("The tracker was taped inside the bumper, wasn't it?", "\"That is what the mechanic said. I did not tape it there. I only know I left it in the car.\""), .cross("You were told to stay away, weren't you?", "\"I was told later. I tried to stay away. I did not think the tracker or the gym was a violation.\"")],
